{"unit_id":"zaimokuza-yoshiteru__dsh-theme-library#readme-1","repo":"zaimokuza-yoshiteru/dsh-theme-library","commit":"d01e9c3f50fa25ea3d8d66a450dd5a48831d0aa6","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@zaimokuza/dsh-theme-library README · dsh-theme-library：DSH 动态壁纸主题库，支持网页端和桌面客户端。\n\n安装 `@zaimokuza/dsh-theme-library`，打开「设置 → 主题管理」，以预览卡片切换壁纸、调整背景透明度，或选择是否调整原生组件底色。设置自动保存。\n\n所有主题均无音轨，支持浅色/深色外观、后台暂停及系统“减少动态效果”设置。\n\n主题管理使用 DSH 原生设置分区。启动时由黑底衔接壁纸首帧；可按 Esc 跳过开场，加载失败或超时会自动放行。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-theme-library"}
{"unit_id":"zaimokuza-yoshiteru__dsh-theme-library#readme-2","repo":"zaimokuza-yoshiteru/dsh-theme-library","commit":"d01e9c3f50fa25ea3d8d66a450dd5a48831d0aa6","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@zaimokuza/dsh-theme-library README · 素材来源：原有五款素材来自 Wallpaper Engine；「雨落狂流之暗」为本项目制作的《龙族》非官方同人场景。","source":"extracted","section":"素材来源"}
